From 58619182d8acd03f482daef34aa9d73dcd46cfcb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:03:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Gateway transports as monthly means against GLORYS and
 against Tsubouchi et al. (2018)

analysis/tsubouchi_comparison.jl reads the online transports and GLORYS's
(glorys_transports.jld2) and writes two markdown tables, printed and saved
as output_dir/tsubouchi_comparison.md: calendar-month means of volume, heat
and freshwater, model against GLORYS on our reference values; and means over
Tsubouchi et al.'s 30-day blocks on their reference values (1.01 degC,
34.67), model and GLORYS against Tsubouchi et al. A figure,
figure_dir/tsubouchi_comparison.png, shows the daily series with their
blocks and uncertainty.

Tsubouchi et al.'s monthly values (Figs. 5a, 7a, 9a, read from the figures)
are in analysis/references/.

